WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:11.482
Open the Autoinstall USB Creator GUI, pick a 64 GiB USB drive, and
verify ISO & bundle paths.

2
00:00:11.522 --> 00:00:27.578
Pre-stage PBKDF2 OSCAR admin password & lanes.csv with first-boot
auto-init, then build.

3
00:00:27.724 --> 00:00:38.325
Run --list-drives to confirm internal NVMe OS and OSCAR_BACKUP
drives remain protected.

4
00:00:38.365 --> 00:01:06.510
Run the CLI with --oscar-admin-password-file, --lanes-file, and
--auto-init-oscar.
